			(property "Capacitance Measurement Conditions" "22 uF +/-10% measured at room temperature, 120+/-24 Hz, 0.5+/-0.1 Vrms (p3); X7R +/-15% over -55..125 C, reference 25 C, no bias. DC bias, AC amplitude, aging and temperature affect capacitance; 22 uF is not guaranteed in circuit at 25 V DC. No numerical effective capacitance under DC bias established from this specification; application-specific evaluation required."
				(at 0 0 0)
				(show_name no)
				(do_not_autoplace no)
				(hide yes)
				(effects
