			(property "Part Origin" "Exact-MPN symbol created by Steve. Reuses the unchanged reviewed OCPM managed R_0805_2012Metric footprint and generic model under the standard passive-package exception. Vishay TNPW 0805 nominal body 2.00 x 1.25 x 0.45 mm; two nonpolar terminals. Shared IPC-style lands 1.025 x 1.40 mm at X +/-0.9125 mm, gap 0.80 mm. Vishay 28950 recommends 0.90 x 1.45 mm lands with 1.00 mm gap. Existing reviewed generic 0805 package selected; dimensional differences are deliberate generic-package reuse, not a claim of exact manufacturer-recommended geometry. Generic model 2.00 x 1.20 x 0.45 mm: width is 0.05 mm below exact nominal body. Approximate visualization only; use 1.25 mm nominal plus datasheet tolerances for mechanical clearance. Original unique draft package and evidence retained in private shared-reuse migration recovery storage. No prior Spec verification is transferred."
				(at 0 0 0)
				(effects
					(font
						(size 1.27 1.27)
					)
					(hide yes)
				)
			)
