			(property "Rating Conditions" "Derate ambient power linearly above 70 C to zero at selected maximum film temperature. Terminal rating requires thermal design; not 0.75 W at 70 C ambient. Working-voltage limit at 402 kohm gives approximately 56 mW at 150 V. See datasheet curves and mode-specific stability limits."
