			(property "Legacy Comparison" "Historical 402 kohm, 0.1%, 25 ppm/C and 0805 match. 150 V rating exceeds historical 100 V. P70 modes exceed 125 mW thermally, but 125 mW at 402 kohm would require 224 V and is not permissible under 150 V limit. No inherited qualification or substitute approval."
