			(property "Part Origin" "Exact-MPN symbol created by Steve. Reuses the unchanged reviewed OCPM managed R_0805_2012Metric footprint and generic model under the standard passive-package exception. Vishay TNPW 0805 nominal body 2.00 x 1.25 x 0.45 mm; two nonpolar terminals. Shared IPC-style lands 1.025 x 1.40 mm at X +/-0.9125 mm, gap 0.80 mm. Vishay 28950 recommends 0.90 x 1.45 mm lands with 1.00 mm gap. Existing reviewed generic 0805 package selected; dimensional differences remain visible for exact-part assembly review. Generic model 2.00 x 1.20 x 0.45 mm has a 0.05 mm nominal width difference. It is not an exact manufacturing/clearance model; use the exact body and tolerances in the retained datasheet. Original unique draft package and evidence retained in private shared-reuse migration recovery storage. No prior Spec verification is transferred."
				(at 0 0 0)
				(show_name no)
				(do_not_autoplace no)
				(hide yes)
				(effects
